description: multilayer-causal XTASK wave - 3x3 CROSS-TASK BK steering transfer matrix on gemma. Rows = SINGLE-TASK BK source axis (sm / ic / mw), cols = APPLY target task (sm / ic / mw); the source axis is steered into the residual stream at the L16-21 write window during the target task's decision rollout, behavior shift measured. Diagonal (s==t) = within-task causal effect (upper bound); off-diagonal = transfer; transfer fraction = offdiag / diag. ISOLATED xtask namespace - arms from configs/arms_xtask.yaml (MLC_ARMS_YAML override), assets under assets/xtask/ (single-task BK npz built target-scaled per CONTRACT4), all HF checkpoint writes under experiments/xtask/ (MLC_HF_BASE override), local rollout jsonls under results/xtask/ (MLC_OUT). Code tarball pulled from the SHARED experiments/multilayer_causal/code asset; only outputs are namespaced. Single gemma batch (all cells are gemma).

target:
  service: sing
  name: msrresrchbasicvc
  workspace_name: msra-sh-aml-ws

environment:
  registry: mcr.microsoft.com
  image: aifx/acpt/stable-ubuntu2204-cu126-py310-torch28x:latest

code:
  local_dir: $CONFIG_DIR/

jobs:
  - name: mlc_xtask
    sku: 80G4-H100
    sla_tier: Standard
    priority: high
    identity: managed
    submit_args:
      max_run_duration_seconds: 86400
      env:
        _AZUREML_SINGULARITY_JOB_UAI: "/subscriptions/c4c534bc-9978-4974-9c87-551f7c5754ef/resourceGroups/msra-sh-aml-rg/providers/Microsoft.ManagedIdentity/userAssignedIdentities/msra-sh-aml-uai"
        HF_TOKEN: HF_TOKEN_PLACEHOLDER
        HUGGING_FACE_HUB_TOKEN: HF_TOKEN_PLACEHOLDER
        # xtask isolation overrides (additive — unset elsewhere, so sm/ic/w-series
        # paths stay byte-identical):
        MLC_ARMS_YAML: multilayer_causal/configs/arms_xtask.yaml
        MLC_HF_BASE: experiments/xtask/checkpoints
        MLC_OUT: multilayer_causal/results/xtask
    command:
      - nvidia-smi
      - |
        bash -c '
        set -x
        source /opt/conda/etc/profile.d/conda.sh
        conda activate ptca
        pip install -q "huggingface_hub<1.0" "transformers>=4.44" accelerate scipy pyyaml 2>&1 | tail -1
        mkdir -p /scratch/mlc
        cd /scratch/mlc
        export HF_HOME=/scratch/mlc/hf_cache
        python -c "
        from huggingface_hub import hf_hub_download
        import os, tarfile
        p = hf_hub_download(\"llm-addiction-research/llm-addiction\", \"experiments/multilayer_causal/code/multilayer_causal.tar.gz\", repo_type=\"dataset\", token=os.environ[\"HF_TOKEN\"])
        tarfile.open(p).extractall(\".\")
        print(\"code extracted\")
        "
        export LLM_ADDICTION_BEHAVIORAL_ROOT=/scratch/mlc/data/behavioral
        python -c "from multilayer_causal.src.ic import ensure_ic_catalog; ensure_ic_catalog()"
        python -c "from multilayer_causal.src.mw import ensure_mw_catalog; ensure_mw_catalog()"
        python -m multilayer_causal.src.xtask_axes --dest-dir multilayer_causal/assets/xtask --target-scaled
        bash multilayer_causal/run_arms.sh 4 xtask_base_sm xtask_base_ic xtask_base_mw xtask_sm_to_sm xtask_ic_to_sm xtask_mw_to_sm xtask_sm_to_ic xtask_ic_to_ic xtask_mw_to_ic xtask_sm_to_mw xtask_ic_to_mw xtask_mw_to_mw xtask_rnd_sm_s0 xtask_rnd_ic_s0 xtask_rnd_mw_s0
        echo XTASK_DONE
        '
